<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Pilkington cut at Goldman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Pilkington cut at Goldman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Glassmaker Pilkington Plc was cut to &quot;market performer&quot; from &quot;market outperformer&quot; at Goldman Sachs, the investment bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Goldman also lowered its earnings per share estimates for the company by an average 15 percent.</p>
<p>The stock was down 3p at 141.</p>
<p>Further detail was not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
